    "text": "By Caleb Pearl ,\n6 hours ago Lewisburg, WV (WOAY) – The 18th Annual Lewisburg Chocolate Festival will take over downtown Lewisburg this Saturday, April 11th. Tasting tickets for the festival are available in packs of five for $5, getting you access to chocolate creations from local vendors and restaurants all around town. At various tasting... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
